OL,3,AUS strikes Iranian launchers on Larak
OL,4,AIsland in first known attack in weeks
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe IRGC said Sunday's attack killed
OL,7,Ftwo people and injured two others, and
OL,8,Fvowed "response and punishment". It
OL,9,Flater said it had launched an attack on
OL,10,FUS military targets in Jordan,
OL,11,Faccording to Iranian state media.
OL,13,FThe BBC has approached Centcom for
OL,14,Fcomment.
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
